{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_15173","headline":"再赴渭北使府留别 · 李益","name":"再赴渭北使府留别","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"结发逐鸣鼙，连兵追谷蠡。\n山川搜伏虏，铠甲被重犀。\n故府旌旗在，新军羽校齐。\n报恩身未死，识路马还嘶。\n列嶂高烽举，当营太白低。\n平戎七尺劒，封检一丸泥。\n截海取蒲类，跑泉饮鸊鹈。\n汉庭中选重，更事五原西。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"李益","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_15173.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_15173","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}